  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.12, g: 0.22, b: 0.21, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 24
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'INSTRUCTION STAMPS

    LEFT / RIGHT: Turn 90 degrees. REVERSE: Turn back.

    WAIT:
    Pause one cycle. FAST: Next move one cycle. SLOW: Next move three cycles. JUMP:
    Cross a small marked gap.


    INK AND PARCELS

    STANDARD executes once per
    visit. DOUBLE executes twice per visit. PERMANENT locks editing until Restart.
    Stamps remain on the sheet through a dispatch.

    FRAGILE: Avoid bumps. EXPRESS:
    Never wait. REGISTERED: Visit every checkpoint.


    PLANNING

    Choose a
    stamp, then tap a marked space. You can also drag a stamp onto the route. LIFT
    INK erases a non-permanent stamp. From chapter 4, choose INK to open the ink
    selector.


    TIMING AND SEALS

    A normal step takes two cycles. Gates show
    open phase / period. Dispatch runs your plan. Pause stops it. Review lets you
    adjust it.

    Delivered: Reach the mailbox. Efficient: Meet par stamp count.
    Perfect Route: Meet par and optimal distance.'
